        MCB_miegamas_lemp[MCB C2: Bedroom Light<br/>Load: 100W<br/>Cable: 3x1.5mm²] ~~~
        MCB_drabuzine_roz[MCB C6: Wardrobe/NAS<br/>Load: 100W<br/>Cable: 3x2.5mm²] ~~~
        MCB_svetaine_roz[MCB B16: Living Room Soc.<br/>Load: 800W<br/>Cable: 3x2.5mm²] 
    end
    
    N_Bar1[N-Bar Rail 1]
    
