    Busbar_1 ==> MCB_vaiko_lemp
    Busbar_1 ==> MCB_svetaine_lemp
    Busbar_1 ==> MCB_miegamas_tv
    Busbar_1 ==> MCB_miegamas_lemp
    Busbar_1 ==> MCB_drabuzine_roz
    Busbar_1 ==> MCB_svetaine_roz    
    
    Incomer_N -->|10mm²| R1    
